      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "We must reject the idea that our citizens' suffering is less important than our own, because true moral courage demands we stand with the vulnerable regardless of borders. Sending aid abroad is not a waste of taxpayer money; it is a direct investment in global stability that prevents future conflicts and economic crises that would eventually cost us far more. We have a fundamental duty to the human race to ensure that no child goes hungry or dies from preventable diseases, and that duty transcends national lines.",
